# --- Provenance: Mojang-derived data must never be committed (SPEC 12) ---
# Anything produced by tools/fetch-vanilla, extracted from a jar, or
# generated by running the vanilla server lives here and stays local.
/.fixtures/
/fixtures/
*.jar
*.mca
*.mcr
*.dat
*.nbt
# Vanilla worldgen JSON extracted from a jar / data generator.
**/vanilla_worldgen/
**/generated/data/minecraft/worldgen/

# The Researcher process and its repository are not a permitted reference
# (CLAUDE.md's provenance rule) -- only its filtered output under spec/ is.
# PROVENANCE.md and RESEARCHER-BRIEF.md are its own notes and provenance
# tracking, and must never land here; they already did once, by accident, in
# 761b8a1. AUDIT.md is deliberately not listed here -- the owner asked to
# leave it as committed rather than have this rule reach it too.
/PROVENANCE.md
/RESEARCHER-BRIEF.md
/RESEARCH-RUN-*.md

